  "body": "Discover a beautifully finished single-level home set on a generous 518m² freehold site in one of Orewa's most desirable new neighbourhoods. Thoughtfully crafted and designed for modern living, this home brings together comfort, style, and everyday convenience in a way that feels instantly welcoming.\r\n\r\nKey Features & Highlights:\r\n*  Backed by a 10 Year Master Build Guarantee for long term confidence  \r\n*  Beautifully finished single level home on a generous 518m² freehold site in sought after Ara Hills  \r\n*  Modern, thoughtful design crafted for comfort, style, and everyday ease  \r\n*  Elevated sea views and sweeping outlooks across Ara Hills - a daily connection to nature  \r\n*  Peaceful, welcoming atmosphere with a strong sense of calm and retreat  \r\n\r\nInterior & Layout:\r\n*  Four generous bedrooms, offering flexibility for families, guests, or work from home  \r\n*  Master suite with private ensuite and walk in wardrobe  \r\n*  Spacious open plan kitchen, dining, and living area with effortless indoor outdoor flow  \r\n*  Light filled central living zone ideal for entertaining or relaxed everyday living  \r\n\r\nPractical Living:\r\n*  Double internal access garage providing secure parking and valuable storage  \r\n*  Well balanced floorplan designed for comfort and functionality in all seasons  \r\n\r\nLocation Benefits:\r\n*  Set within the tranquil Ara Hills community\r\n*  Close to excellent schools, Orewa Beach, and the vibrant amenities of the Hibiscus Coast  \r\n*  Quick motorway access for easy commuting and convenience  \r\n\r\nThis exceptional property must be seen to be fully appreciated.\r\nContact Shaun - 021 871 252 for your private viewing.",
